{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0324_1000_p", "source_sha256": "eb6312b204b2047b9c7abb9109694a7bf84fdc8c0ba9e5e91d67cf3e4a30b497", "ja": "（美希とジュリアのポスター撮影が終わった。\n双子星のお姫様というテーマに、ピッタリだったな！）", "zh": "（美希和茱莉亚的海报拍摄结束了。\n以双子星公主为主题，真是再合适不过了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0324_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "64842b5251586609ab62b67c270292259f49ec5ec4840c35de3ffaeacdc57ad6", "ja": "お疲れさまなの～！　ね、{$P$}！\n今日のミキとジュリア、どうだった？", "zh": "辛苦啦～！对吧，{$P$}！\n今天的美希和茱莉亚，表现得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0324_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7de7c732e4e849b0990b6b9a0b93427bfd883f97cb507daa1495a8dd512e7623", "ja": "お疲れ様。ふたりともバッチリだ！\nかわいくてお姫様らしい、素敵な写真が撮れたよ。", "zh": "辛苦了。两个人都非常棒！\n拍到了既可爱又有公主风范的精彩照片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0324_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "d424a4d463bdb60c1b3fe85ebd4cab595a15aec5c902bef32e569f93f6dc6434", "ja": "よかったの～☆　次は、{$P$}が\nカメラマンね。お姫様たちのオフショットなの♪", "zh": "太好了～☆　接下来换{$P$}当\n摄影师了哦。要拍公主们的花絮照片呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0324_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "ca8c8d4c10edf4d9c367dfc0877948c67cf4ee0d943abc2e3d13a11f15d63309", "ja": "お姫様たち……って、あたしもか！？\nオフショットなら、着替えてからでもよくないか？", "zh": "公主们……等等，我也算吗！？\n既然是花絮照，换完衣服再拍不也行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0324_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "46eda7249f69b1110c1b506b4c4347a0ef793397a781e438d9e3f24a56c1f0bc", "ja": "よくないの！\nお姫様のオフショットってところが大事なの。", "zh": "才不好呢！\n重点就在于是公主的花絮照呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0324_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "5422f19d800ca299061c9cc0e2f3e8bfb7991c71d7bc4180a6a9ee4443317205", "ja": "それにジュリアも撮りたいよね？\n{$P$}とツーショット♪", "zh": "而且，也想拍茱莉亚吧？  \n和{$P$}的双人合照♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0324_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "695d4ec66511bbe84984d9dd4c50fd4a941333bdb9a6dca9da6e979aa27c5946", "ja": "は、はあ！？　何言ってるんだよ、美希。\nあたしは別にそんなの……。", "zh": "哈、哈！？你在说什么啊，美希。\n我又不是想要那种……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0324_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b78f598a9cccb7c620119e50898d16971f9704ac54e951df54e5d7b8097fa4ec", "ja": "ま、まあまあ。オフショットは必要でね。\n着替える前に撮らせてもらえると助かるよ。ただ……。", "zh": "好、好了。花絮照还是需要的。\n要是能在换衣服前让我拍几张，就帮大忙了。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0324_1009_p", "source_sha256": "59f0dd1d985c7809f00f18fc9d434b420947518a2fcc911d4eb5b536e76b99a9", "ja": "この暗さだと、写りが悪いかもしれない。\n照明機材は片付けてるし、今から借りるのもな……。", "zh": "这么暗的话，拍出来的效果可能不太好。\n灯光设备都已经收起来了，现在再去借也有点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0324_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "8994998cbec6a2d5d98d1e9d9eb8d91e3266ce6a887d8384803077bba9f249ae", "ja": "そっか。今撮ったら、ミキたち真っ黒だね☆\nもうちょっと明るかったら、キレイに写るかな？", "zh": "这样啊。现在拍的话，我们会变成一片漆黑吧☆\n要是再亮一点，就能拍得更好看了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0324_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "88bea50e01ea288ee4e3138670e33e1c236307f0b1bfa12d2bd1971a542be43f", "ja": "そうだな。照明の代わりになる物があれば\nいいんだけど……。なあ、美希。今日は……。", "zh": "是啊。要是有能代替灯光的东西就好了……喂，美希。今天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0324_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "64f98315e1be0ee936a5f24c83d8da88a8a1e921deebc315dbe95149c2ab2b9f", "ja": "えっと、グッズのお店は……あ、あったの。\n{$P$}、ジュリア、あっちなの！", "zh": "那个，周边商品店……啊，找到了。\n{$P$}、茱莉亚，在那边！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0324_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "aef3ce627f07cab430adc9d61c4d92877f67c06f59083cae2fc10e816b7dd6f8", "ja": "あっちって……なんだ？　お土産でも買うつもりか？\nそれこそ着替えてから……。", "zh": "你说的“那边”……是指什么？打算买伴手礼吗？\n至少也该先换好衣服再去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0324_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "3c613ef5aefac5d47f1d526995329b99d24c2fcd06888a4149ba11bbc3c66ebe", "ja": "ううん。お土産じゃなくて、探しに行くんだよ。\nライトみたいにピカピカ光るの！", "zh": "不是哦。不是去买伴手礼，而是要去找那个。\n会像灯一样闪闪发光！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0324_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "b58c226c9126cd445ea18724cfd4b458ee3c1f607122d6dcfc2bec980064d70b", "ja": "はっ？", "zh": "啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0324_1016_p", "source_sha256": "8fbc18378d8c6b876c848a2660d17cdee2e161fbb6b6bf4d1b263a26e00f052e", "ja": "そうか。グッズの中に光る物があるかもしれないな。\nよし。行ってみるか！", "zh": "这样啊。周边里说不定有会发光的东西。\n好，去看看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0324_1017_003mik", "source_sha256": "ab7bee9c9deceab7bdeb7a04da6bc90a685abda89332bb415f9a570e8182a94d", "ja": "うん♪　キラキラだったり、カワイイのがいいな～。\nほら、ジュリアも早く～！", "zh": "嗯♪　闪闪发光的，或是可爱的就好啦～。\n来嘛，茱莉亚也快点～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0324_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "d744dce3073429ecf3f31dfe8f326ea249830c186e072c23315203df698ba106", "ja": "あ、ああ。……はあー。ほんと、たくましいな。\n仕方ない、最後まで付き合うか。", "zh": "啊，嗯。……唉——真是精力充沛啊。\n没办法，那就陪你到最后吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0324_1019_003mik", "source_sha256": "103bed7336eb44b76f368db2394ee39241650770b7200f1931899d17f9b75afe", "ja": "スリーショットどうしよう～？　ミキとジュリアで\n{$P$}のほっぺにキスする？", "zh": "三人合照怎么办呢～？美希和茱莉亚要不要亲一下{$P$}的脸颊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0324_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "670c11f29b822961679247fd91e88bb43229c3619b51c38d538fbce5393e66a5", "ja": "しないよっ！\nそこはふつうでいいだろ……ったく。", "zh": "才不要呢！\n那里正常一点不就好了……真是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0324_1021_p", "source_sha256": "895a2dc8b6f89303fae093a04d1db0e6e4538728479fad774c31a2aa6b0def14", "ja": "（ライトを買って、無事オフショットを撮影した！\nその後、美希たちが使ったグッズは売り切れたらしい）", "zh": "（买了灯，顺利拍完了花絮照！之后听说美希她们用过的周边也卖光了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
